title portrait and square recorder, recording, LIM and LOW CUT both off (dim lamps in the meter panel)
sizes 320x480 480x800 480x480 720x720
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO recording
env CASSETTE_DEMO_LIM off
env CASSETTE_DEMO_LOWCUT off
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 600
shot lamp-a-off
expect text "LIM"
expect text "PEAK"
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
